---
// CTA final antes del closing (clientes + partnerships).
---

<div class="fcta">
  <h2>Let's change healthcare work.</h2>
  <p>
    Tell us about your workflows. We'll show you how Wúru's agents run them —
    from intake to last-mile delivery.
  </p>
  <a class="fcta-btn" href="mailto:hola@wuru.ai?subject=W%C3%BAru%20Demo" title="Book a demo" rel="noopener noreferrer">
    BOOK A DEMO
  </a>
</div>

<style lang="scss">
  .fcta {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 720px;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }
  h2 {
    margin: 0 auto 18px;
    max-width: 16ch;
    font-size: clamp(32px, 4.6vw, 58px);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.02;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--fg);
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  p {
    margin: 0 auto 34px;
    max-width: 46ch;
    font-size: clamp(15px, 1.4vw, 18px);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
  }
  .fcta-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: #fff;
    background: var(--accent);
    padding: 16px 36px;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    border-radius: 100px;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease, filter 0.2s ease;

    &:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      filter: brightness(1.08);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(236, 90, 61, 0.32);
    }
  }
</style>
